Cell["\<\
34. An integer summand of size > 1 cannot be squeezed to {b} (it would lose \
data)
\[LongDash] rejected cleanly, not leaked.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->132788141,ExpressionUUID->"d13eb41f-eb1c-2a4b-b10a-061455f1376b"],

