Cell["\<\
37-38. A {} summand is the unit literal 1 (einx '()'): concat 'b c, -> b (c + \
())'
and split 'b (q + ()) -> b q, b' behave exactly like the literal-1 forms.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->929938185,ExpressionUUID->"fa5623aa-a976-3442-a300-396056cfdc2f"],

