Cell["\<\
21. A size > 1 literal is NOT a shared contraction identity across operands: \
two
'2's in different operands must not become the same axis \[LongDash] reject \
(einx.dot rejects
'a 2, 2 b -> a b': a contracted axis must be named).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->822419971,ExpressionUUID->"bd0aff63-0c01-5240-9999-8e6564664c4c"],

