Cell["Hygiene.wlt", "Section",
 CellID->720163247,ExpressionUUID->"ac8828db-ef77-8c4a-b531-94d135888a04"],

Cell["\<\
Tests for desc evaluation-hygiene and the string axis tier (feat/desc-hygiene).

The desc eDSL must distinguish three uses of the same surface syntax: a \
binder
`a_` (an axis to be solved), a bracket `#a` = Slot[\"a\"] (a named op-axis), \
and a
bare `a` (env capture \[LongDash] evaluates to its value UNLESS its name is \
an established
axis identity, then a hygienic reference).  A globally shadowed axis symbol \
(a
`Block[{c=3},...]`) must not leak its value into an axis identity.  A string \
`\"a\"`
(valid identifier) is the fully-hygienic axis spelling.

Run via: wolframscript -script scripts/run-tests.wls
BeginTestSection/EndTestSection are MUnit markers; the runner loads MUnit`.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->707238485,ExpressionUUID->"682817ca-ccf9-e44f-8aa2-9c8236d169d2"],

Cell["Einstoff`DescHygiene", "Subsection",
 CellID->321293292,ExpressionUUID->"0032714e-6a15-f449-b4af-ba90cd566a71"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
  RowBox[{"a", ",", "b", ",", "c", ",", "k", ",", "r", ",", "n"}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellID->710429168,ExpressionUUID->"d819b880-ee30-2947-98ab-1817b2d9ac36"],

Cell["Fixtures.", "Text",
 CellID->464743665,ExpressionUUID->"97eca12a-b21f-9448-b948-b890ec6af019"],

Cell["x23 = {{1,2,3},{4,5,6}} ; x24 = {{1,..,4},{5,..,8}}", "Text",
 CellID->588222463,ExpressionUUID->"de1858dc-d9f0-6d42-bc17-33cf08d0edd6"],

Cell["\<\
1. HEADLINE: a shadowed binder must not capture its value.  Today this is \
$Failed
(the `{s}` extraction re-evaluates c -> 3); it must equal the unshadowed swap.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->555143557,ExpressionUUID->"9a2a566b-ce9b-974f-8dbc-8064bf41e452"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"x", "=", 
     RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Range", "[", "6", "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"2", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"Block", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"c", "=", "3"}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Einstoff", "[", "ArrayReshape", "]"}], "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"a_", ",", "c_"}], "}"}], "}"}], "\[RuleDelayed]", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"c", ",", "a"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", "x", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "VerificationTest",\

 CellID->398660108,ExpressionUUID->"f88ff544-8d50-414b-bb37-4b7ec6f9f411"],

