Cell["\<\
22b. ...and even a LOCKED stray value cannot leak: the boundary purge uses \
Clear (values
only, not attributes) which works on a Locked symbol, so axisSymbol still \
yields a
value-less identity.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->126196208,ExpressionUUID->"ad076ceb-e04e-1b47-9c43-5bc9259b5995"],

