Cell["\<\
25. A scoped operator on a shadowed bracket axis still lowers correctly \
through the
purge + memo-reset + einAxisCatch wrapping (regression that the scope \
wrapping did
not break the normal shadowed path).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->457408461,ExpressionUUID->"b70a4798-a4fb-2b46-87cf-fa6516efab33"],

