Cell["\<\
6e. A repeated axis name within the OUTPUT shape is rejected (einx: \"must \
not contain
multiple vectorized axes with the same name\") \[LongDash] a universal \
invariant (no layout);
distinct-across-shapes is fine.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->736362233,ExpressionUUID->"2dbab541-0c2a-9e4d-bdea-b17b59387648"],

