Cell["Reduce.wlt", "Section",
 CellID->89462664,ExpressionUUID->"7454a7a7-7051-6542-913d-f47da31dd0eb"],

Cell["\<\
Tests for the reduce lowering path (Einstoff[ArrayReduce]).
The reducer is curried: Einstoff[ArrayReduce][reducer][desc, tensors, \
bindings].
One file per lowering path under tests/; cf. Reshape.wlt.
Run via: wolframscript -script scripts/run-tests.wls
BeginTestSection/EndTestSection are MUnit markers; the runner loads MUnit`
so they carry section semantics. The .wlt itself does not import MUnit`.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->19655126,ExpressionUUID->"8fd376fb-80bc-0b41-8a9a-c7923974806d"],

Cell["Einstoff`Lowering`Reduce", "Subsection",
 CellID->928087176,ExpressionUUID->"f63e41f5-ede3-4b44-af14-700829688188"],

