Cell["\<\
===================== desc is not held (a feature) ==============\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->62550765,ExpressionUUID->"e8a54bf3-54fd-9f4a-b3a1-ed2a3424aef6"],

Cell["\<\
No operator holds desc, so a bare reference whose symbol is globally bound is
substituted: a bound integer reads as a literal dimension; an illegal value \
is
rejected by the existing checks. (Binding `name_` are still Pattern-held.)\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->94453039,ExpressionUUID->"2f0db638-e7b6-064a-ae90-2283690cb4d7"],

