Cell["\<\
A within-tensor contraction shrinks the element count \[LongDash] not \
bijective; ArrayReshape
points at Einstoff[\"ArrayContract\"] (which accepts it \[LongDash] see \
ArrayContract.wlt).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->858690944,ExpressionUUID->"0683b51c-2f6e-f44d-884c-8844eb287868"],

