Cell["\<\
26d. A string-tier axis that needs an explicit size (a composite split \
factor) can be
supplied with the string-tier key \"a\" -> n in the raw matcher (SPEC \
\[Section]5.7), converted
to the same Symbol[\"a\"] identity the term side uses.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->868814857,ExpressionUUID->"7b09a6b9-43b3-4541-b7c7-4f03f83547ab"],

