Cell["\<\
26e-f. An invalid string axis name (not an identifier) is a clean unsat \
reason in the
raw matcher, NOT a Symbol::symname crash \[LongDash] for a string term and a \
string binding key
alike (string names validated before Symbol[\[Ellipsis]], SPEC \[Section]5.6).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->710813350,ExpressionUUID->"12e17d89-d77e-1d4b-83b3-2b392258ab46"],

