Cell["\<\
26i-l. The raw string tier is Block-immune: a shadowed global of the axis \
name does
NOT leak its value into the env key (axisSymbol maps a shadowed name to a \
value-less
private-context symbol whose SymbolName is still the user name).  An UNBOUND \
name keeps
the clean Global` symbol as key.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->635844124,ExpressionUUID->"f9e4629b-e169-8a4b-bda3-e2f341ad66c6"],

