Cell["\<\
31. A size > 1 literal still cannot be carried even with a {} unit beside it:
'2 () 3 -> 2 1 3' rejects (anonymous 2 and 3 have no carryable identity; einx \
errors).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->992205359,ExpressionUUID->"24bc0bed-3b79-2744-8358-040a5ab4e457"],

